@policy=http://localhost:5102
@rating=http://localhost:5101
### REST direct
POST {{rating}}/api/ratings/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
{"policyNumber":"TAP-1001","sumInsured":100000,"riskScore":5}
### HTTP sync
POST {{policy}}/api/policies/sync-http
Content-Type: application/json
{"policyNumber":"TAP-1001","sumInsured":100000,"riskScore":5,"customerEmail":"customer@example.com"}
### HTTP async (copy Location/job id then GET it)
POST {{policy}}/api/policies/async-http
Content-Type: application/json
{"policyNumber":"TAP-1002","sumInsured":200000,"riskScore":7,"customerEmail":"customer@example.com"}
### gRPC through demo endpoint
POST {{policy}}/api/policies/grpc
Content-Type: application/json
{"policyNumber":"TAP-1003","sumInsured":300000,"riskScore":8,"customerEmail":"customer@example.com"}
### Queue
POST {{policy}}/api/installments/queue
Content-Type: application/json
{"jobId":"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111","policyNumber":"TAP-1001","installmentNumber":1,"customerEmail":"customer@example.com"}
### Pub/Sub
POST {{policy}}/api/policies/broadcast
Content-Type: application/json
{"eventId":"22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222","occurredUtc":"2026-10-29T08:00:00Z","policyNumber":"TAP-1001","premium":1500,"customerEmail":"customer@example.com"}
### Event-driven
POST {{policy}}/api/policies/events
Content-Type: application/json
{"eventId":"33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333","occurredUtc":"2026-10-29T08:00:00Z","policyNumber":"TAP-1001","premium":1500,"customerEmail":"customer@example.com"}
